 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Devastating Barrage</em></p>\n<p>As a bonus action for 2 CE, you cover your hands in <em>Missile Fists</em>, gaining the following benefits for 1 minute:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You gain a +2 bonus to AC while holding no weapons or shields.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can use your CE modifier for attack and damage rolls using your unarmed strikes.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your unarmed strikes deal your <em>Missile Fist</em> damage.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The range of your unarmed strikes becomes 10 ft.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
